    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d782">

                <pb facs="1011" n="915" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg915"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Day to the President.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-09-30"><hi rendition="#italic">September 30,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Minister for foreign affairs gave joint entertainment yesterday to the two
                    Commissions. Passed off very agreeably. Meet for business to-morrow.
                    Commissioners will be presented, to the President of France on Tuesday. Can you
                    send word of greeting to him to be delivered at our presentation?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Day.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
